# Architecture

- `.claude/prompts/architecture.md` describes this system's stack, layout, entry
  points, and data flow. Consult it before designing anything that spans modules.
- Respect existing layer boundaries: do not import across layers in directions
  the current code avoids (e.g. domain logic importing from the web layer).
- Significant architectural changes (new services, new layers, new cross-cutting
  patterns) must be proposed and agreed before implementation — do not introduce
  them silently inside a feature change.
- Keep changes localized: a feature should touch the minimum set of modules
  consistent with the existing architecture.
